{"about_the_game":"&quot;Welcome to 'Joyful Animal Chorus,' a delightful game where you can create music using various sounds!<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n1. Initially, the game includes many animal characters and common musical instruments for composing.<br />\r\n2. You can upload your own sound effects and images to create your unique characters.<br />\r\n3. Each room in the game represents an independent band. You can manage and decorate them (including plants, furniture, and decorations, which you can create yourself). After composing for each character, you can orchestrate a unified performance.<br />\r\n4. You can upload the entire room's music to the Creative Workshop or subscribe to compositions by other players.<br />\r\n5. Characters, plants, furniture, and decorations you create can all be uploaded to the Creative Workshop or subscribed to from other players' creations.<br />\r\n6. Within the rooms, you can select characters to perform music.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCurrently, the game development is being done by one person, so there may be some unknown issues and inconveniences in certain operations. Continuous optimization and improvement of the game will be carried out later. If you encounter any issues or have suggestions, please post them in the Community Center. Let's discuss and resolve them together promptly. We hope everyone can find joy in the game.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2775230/fd41ca0b678034945d2349c2d0292fcde2c756e6.jpg"},{"name":"2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2775230/9c686e0cac7dc410c1bbb03077617f54a3fb7763.jpg"},{"name":"3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2775230/8f56ab3608284826927b3bdf9b04643e5a5fb963.jpg"},{"name":"4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2775230/ea88ed5d83679f3ce2dcd493fa7c6a397066d26b.jpg"